{'symbol': 'CE', 'date': '2021-12-01 16:15:00', 'title': 'CELANESE COMPLETES ACQUISITION OF SANTOPRENE™ TPV ELASTOMERS BUSINESS', 'text': 'DALLAS--(BUSINESS WIRE)---- $CE--CELANESE CORPORATION (NYSE: CE), A GLOBAL CHEMICAL AND SPECIALTY MATERIALS COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS COMPLETED THE ACQUISITION OF THE SANTOPRENE™ TPV ELASTOMERS BUSINESS OF EXXON MOBIL CORPORATION. “WE ARE EXCITED TO WELCOME THE SANTOPRENE™ TEAM TO CELANESE,” SAID LORI RYERKERK, CHAIRMAN AND CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER. “THEY HAVE BUILT AN INDUSTRY-RENOWNED BRAND AND PRODUCT PORTFOLIO IN THE SANTOPRENE™ BUSINESS THAT WILL IMMEDIATELY STRENGTHEN THE UNRIVALED PORTFOLIO'}